"""v64.0: section-specific questions for Pasha 6e sections the curriculum bank does not cover.

These sections (the facial aesthetic sections, sleep physiology, robotic surgery,
otologic visualization, the pediatric encounter and the staging index) had no curriculum topic
of their own, so their quizzes were borrowing unrelated questions. These are original
board-style questions written for each section, in the site's own words.

v64.1 (book audit of all 88 sections against Pasha & Golub 6e): every section now has
section-specific questions that fill the gaps the reviewers found, listed after the original ones.
Fixes from the audit: augmentation question 3 now asks about bone resorption with subperiosteal
placement (the book prefers a supraperiosteal pocket); the great auricular nerve question moved
from rhytidoplasty to facelift-complications, the ideal brow position question from brow to
facial-aesthetics, and the non-EPI DWI cholesteatoma question from otologic-visualization to
noninfectious-ear; the infant larynx level and the chin reference line were corrected.
Sections are listed in book order. Ids are positional (pasha:<chapter>:<section>:<n>).
Row format: (stem, [4 choices], answer_index, explanation).
"""

